{"title":"Friday Dink & Strategy Clinic (1hr Lesson + Optional 1hr Game)","startsAt":"2026-10-09T18:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-09T19:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"### **Friday Dink & Strategy Clinic (1hr Lesson + Optional 1hr Game)**\n\n* **6:00 PM - 7:00 PM:** Pickleball Dink & Strategy Clinic (GTA Pickleball Lessons)\n* **7:00 PM - 8:00 PM (Optional):** Extra hour of game play available for an extra $5 per person. (Note: The optional extra hour (7-8 PM) requires at least 4 players to agree and depends on court availability. Please let me know early if you are interested!)\n\n**Are you ready to elevate your pickleball game?** Join our exclusive, small-group clinic designed for players who want to move beyond just hitting hard and master the soft game. If you want to improve your dinking, court positioning, and stacking strategies, this session is perfect for you!\n\n**Meet Your Instructor** Hi, I'm Jeong, an NCCP-certified Level 2 pickleball and tennis instructor based in the GTA. I focus on helping players build solid technical fundamentals and strategic court awareness to win more rallies.\n\n**Verified Coach Profiles & Reviews**\n\n* [Superprof.ca](https://www.superprof.ca/nccp-certified-tennis-pickleball-instructor-teaching-the-basic-theory-and-practical-skills-tennis-pickl.html)\n* [Teachme.to](https://teachme.to/listings/pickleball/pickleball-with-jeong-sohn?skill=pickleball&latitude=43.866955&longitude=-79.440567)\n* [Playtogether.ca](https://playtogether.ca/about/)\n\n**What to Expect (60-Minute Session):**\n\n* **Warm-up & Assessment:** Quick rallies to assess your current level and identify key areas for improvement.\n* **Core Skills Training:** Step-by-step drills focusing on dink consistency, tactical positioning, and an introduction to stacking strategies.\n* **Guided Match Play:** Apply what you've learned in organized mini-games with real-time, personalized feedback.\n\n**Event Details:**\n\n* **Location:** Swing Star (5 Connie Crescent Unit 1, Vaughan, ON)\n* **Date & Time:** Every (Fri) 6-7pm\n* **Skill Level:** Beginner to Low-Intermediate\n* **Spots Available:** Strictly limited to 6-8 players to ensure quality coaching.\n* **Fee:** $20 (Covers court usage, practice balls, and instruction).\n* **Min-Max** Students: 3-6 (If there are fewer than 3 registrations, the amount paid via PayPal will be refunded via e-Transfer)\n* **Optional Extra Hour**: If you'd like to stay and play games after the 6-7 PM lesson, an additional hour (7-8 PM) is available for just **$5 per person**. This option is available if at least 4 players stay!","venue":{"name":"Swing Star - Indoor Golf And Pickleball","address":"1-15 Connie Crescent,, Vaughan","lat":43.82043,"lng":-79.49217,"city":"Vaughan"},"fee":{"amount":20,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"Play Together Pickleball GTA for all levels","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/2/7/b/highres_535797979.jpeg"}